{"definition":"D5","value":"You tell Mabel what she got up to.\nYou spared no juicy detail.\nShe blushed a lot."}
{"definition":"D6","value":"Bucky leaves the store.\n\nMaverick looks under the counter to see a mess of critters and spunk.\nThe coyotes are hungrily lapping away at Rascal."}
{"definition":"D8","value":"Return to The Musky Mustelid to make more deliveries for Maverick."}
{"definition":"D2","value":"This is an <u>ADULT GAME</u> featuring a ton\nof <u>EXPLICIT CONTENT.</u>"}
{"definition":"D3","value":"If you are a kid, <color=#EE1005><u>GET OUTA HERE!</u></color>\nIf not, please enjoy!"}
